+      # ===== 模型坐标下的关节反馈（喂给观测前的换算值）=====
+      - /wheel_leg/rl/model/left_hip_joint/angle
+      - /wheel_leg/rl/model/left_hip_joint/velocity
+      - /wheel_leg/rl/model/left_knee_joint/angle
